WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You sort of always have done
material that some people

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:06.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
would say is on
the wrong side of taste.

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:10.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
You actually told
Hitler jokes in Berlin.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-How did that go?

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:12.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They loved it.
-Yeah.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:13.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Honestly.
-I bet, though.

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:14.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, it's a piece
I do everywhere.

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:15.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
I do the same show everywhere.
-Yeah.

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:18.151
-And, you know, you think, "Oh,
is Hitler gonna go down well?"

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.487 line:92%
And I was worried about it.

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:21.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just started it
and I just said,

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:23.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Yeah, come on,
let's talk about Hitler."

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.892 line:92%
And they loved it, you know?

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:27.827 line:92%
But, yeah, Hitler's universal.

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:31.831 size:84% position:42%
Everyone, you know --
I mean, you'll never --

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:34.501 size:84% position:42%
I'll never stop finding
the funny in Hitler.

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:37.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I agree with you.
-It annoys me, as well, right?

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
One thing about Hitler
that annoys me.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:43.109 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:46.179
-All right, but make your case,
but just know...

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:49.682
-Hear me out. Hear me out.
-All right. Let's hear him.

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.217
-It's not gonna be crass, right?
You know.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:56.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
No. When people say --
In all, like, sci-fi things,

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:58.324 size:84% position:42%
the first thing someone
does when they've got

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:00.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
a time machine is --
they go back and kill Hitler.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've talked about this.
They say, "Yeah, I'd do that."

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:05.298
I go, "You're just saying --
You haven't thought about it.

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:06.399 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's not the
first thing you'd do.

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:07.667 size:88% position:44%
You'd go back and meet
your nan or something --

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:09.502
do you know what I mean? --
when she was young, right?

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:11.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know why.
I don't know why I'd do that.

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:12.605 line:92%
I wouldn't do that, right?

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:16.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The weird thing would be is
if she was with Hitler.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:17.377 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:18.812 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-I'd go like, "Oh, no!"

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:21.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
-One-stop shopping.
One-stop shopping.

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:23.883 line:92%
No. And I say, "Why would you --

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
They tried to kill
Hitler at the time."

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:27.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they go, "No, I'd kill him
when he was a baby."

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:29.923
And I think,
"How could you -- You couldn't.

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
Have you seen how
cute Hitler was as a baby?

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:34.794 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No. I have never seen
Hitler's baby -- You have it?

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:40.533 size:75% position:38%
-Yeah. Right? Right?
Look at this, right?

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:41.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, there it is.
Look how cute...

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:45.105
-There. Go over there.
-...Hitler was as a little baby.

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:48.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
-All right? Yeah.

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:50.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, as if you
could go back and strangle --

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:52.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
He hasn't even done --
Don't forget --

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:54.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
he hasn't done
anything wrong yet.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:54.547 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:56.249
-So you're gonna go back
and be like, "Coochie-coo,"

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:57.050 line:92%
and then you're gonna -- No.

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:59.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
He hasn't done --
Let's see what happens.

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:01.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
Also, I wouldn't kill him.
I'd change him.

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:04.190
I'd just be nice to him,
get him into art college.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I see.
You'd just change him. Yeah.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:06.693 line:92%
-Because you don't know --

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:09.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, I know what
you're thinking.

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:13.266 size:84% position:42%
Why have I got pictures
of Hitler on my phone?

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:14.467 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:15.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There's a story
behind this, actually.

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:17.203 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have got pictures of Hitler
on my phone as a baby

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:20.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I did a tweet once --
"Who's the cutest?"

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:23.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was Hitler, right?
-Uh-huh.

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:25.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Versus -- Oh, where is he?
Where is he?

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:29.249 size:78% position:39%
Anything could pop up
on this phone, right?

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:31.084 line:92%
Oh, yeah. That's me, right?

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:33.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I did, "Who's the cutest?"
-Yeah.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:39.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I won, but only just.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:41.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there's another thing
about having pictures

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:43.496 line:92%
of Hitler on your phone, right?

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:45.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've got an iWatch.
-Yeah.

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:46.266 line:92%
-And, sometimes, the screen --

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:49.536
it just throws up random photos
that are on your phone.

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:50.737 line:92%
So I can be in a meeting,

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:55.074 size:78% position:39%
and just baby Hitler
pops up on the phone.

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:57.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I can see that I --
"Is that your kid?"

00:02:57.577 --> 00:03:00.847 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"No. It's, uh...No.

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:02.315 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's -- it's --

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:05.618 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, it's Hitler."

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:06.286 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Thank you so much.

00:03:06.286 --> 00:03:08.721 align:start size:94% position:6%
Always such
a pleasure to see you.

